                <pb facs="0350" n="252" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg252"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Goodnow.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Assurances of Viceroy Liu cordially appreciated. Now that anarchy controls
                    capital, the President trusts to responsible provincial authorities to maintain
                    order and fulfill treaty and international obligations of Chinese nation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
